# NOTE: `_headers` is a Cloudflare Pages feature — GitHub Pages (this fork's
# deploy) ignores it entirely, so it's inert here and kept only so a Cloudflare
# deploy stays correct. connect-src must therefore also allow the data plane
# (https://trisiak.github.io/factorio-pack-data), which the editor fetches
# packs.json + each pack's data.json/atlas from cross-origin.
/*
    X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
    Referrer-Policy: strict-origin
    Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com https://trisiak.github.io; worker-src blob:; frame-ancestors 'none';

https://:project.pages.dev/*
    X-Robots-Tag: noindex
